# 0.5.1

- Add methylation clock packages: EpigeneticAgePipeline (GitHub, pinned to commit 5fc14f1, as in the separate meclock:0.2.0 image), methylclock, EpiDISH, FlowSorted.Blood.450k, ComplexHeatmap, glmmTMB, and circlize
- List broom, data.table, and rstatix explicitly (already installed as dependencies)
- GitHub packages in packages.txt can be pinned as user/repo@sha

# 0.5.0

- Bioc 3.23 (R 4.6.1)
- Add e1071, pals, randomForest, and yaml, which 0.3.0_manual had and 0.4.0 did not
- List all packages in packages.txt and install them with one BiocManager::install() call, which also installs the GitHub packages (replaces install.packages() and devtools::install_github())
- Fail the build if any listed package doesn't load (check.R)
- Pin CRAN packages to a dated Posit Package Manager snapshot (CRAN_SNAPSHOT in the Dockerfile)
- Build preprocessCore from the Bioc 3.23 source package with threading disabled, instead of cloning its GitHub HEAD (the Bioc development version)
- Record the installed package versions and R session in /opt/orochi_r, and upload them with each build as a workflow artifact

